Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.13,Chapter,,0,0,0,,01 / AIRPORT OPERATIONS
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A synthetic airport day: 420 flights, with operations updating live.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.06,0:00:08.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The simulation clock drives flight states and runway throughput.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.13,0:00:16.14,Chapter,,0,0,0,,02 / PHYSICAL CONTEXT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.13,0:00:12.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,L1 adds physical context: gates, runways and ground vehicles.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.13,0:00:16.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The ground view brings aircraft and vehicle activity together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:21.15,Chapter,,0,0,0,,03 / DISRUPTION INJECTION
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.14,0:00:21.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We inject a critical runway incursion on runway 09L.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.15,0:00:31.19,Chapter,,0,0,0,,04 / CASCADE ANALYSIS
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.15,0:00:26.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The runway incursion triggers a closure and an arrival holding stack.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.17,0:00:31.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The cascade then stops departures and congests gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.19,0:00:39.30,Chapter,,0,0,0,,05 / FINANCIAL IMPACT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.19,0:00:35.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,L3 connects operational events to costs, revenue and P&L.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.25,0:00:39.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The injected runway incident adds EUR 25,000 in direct costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:46.37,Chapter,,0,0,0,,06 / DECISION SUPPORT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.30,0:00:46.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Recommendations estimate the cost and savings of possible responses.
